  "releaseNotes": "v4.3.0 — Test coverage + performance hardening.\n• New tests: 78 new tests covering batch operations, API routing, export/import, history store, event bus, execution buckets, name validation, config, CSRF, error handling, multi-scheduler, and callback verification (289 total, 0 failures).\n• Perf: InMemoryFireHistoryStore.CountFiltered now uses explicit override avoiding O(n) materialization from the default interface method.\n• InternalsVisibleTo added for test projects (QoL for contributors).",
